Third-party material
====================

minimp3 (https://github.com/lieff/minimp3)
------------------------------------------
Portions of this crate are ported from minimp3 by lieff and contributors:
the Huffman code tables in their compact lookup format (src/huffman.rs),
the Layer I/II bit allocation and dequantization (src/layer12.rs), the
Layer III scale factor, stereo, alias reduction and IMDCT kernels
(src/layer3.rs, src/tables.rs) and the polyphase synthesis filterbank
(src/synth.rs).

